      "reason": "player_info: vanilla 26.1 ClientboundPlayerInfoUpdatePacket Action ids are UPDATE_LIST_ORDER 6 and UPDATE_HAT 7, and UPDATE_LISTED carries a boolean; the description swaps the top two flag bits and types listed as varint (net/minecraft/network/protocol/game/ClientboundPlayerInfoUpdatePacket.java)",
